        "original_id": "40fb3c7c-6805-5cfd-ba71-2cdca7c40d45",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Ezhou, Quzhou, Hubei Province, Zhejiang Province, China, Annam\n- People: Trần Ích Tắc\n- Organizations: Yuan Dynasty\n- Topics: prefecture-level cities, exile, failed restoration attempts\n\nFacts:\n- Ezhou is a prefecture-level city in eastern Hubei Province, China.\n- Quzhou is a prefecture-level city in western Zhejiang Province, People's Republic of China.\n- After another failed Yuan Dynasty attempt to restore Trần Ích Tắc as King of Annam, Trần Ích Tắc continued to live in Ezhou, Hubei.\n- Trần Ích Tắc ultimately died on foreign soil.",
